{"title": "Personal Space", "pageid": 28543, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Personal_Space", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Personal Space</b> is a passive feature that improves the wearer's Armor Class after shoving.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>After shoving an enemy<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\"><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Notes\">See Notes</a>]</i></sup>, the wearer gains a +1 to their <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> until their next turn. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Enhanced_Armour_Class\"> Condition: Enhanced Armour Class </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Armour_Class_(Condition)\" title=\"Enhanced Armour Class (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Enhanced_Armour_Class_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Enhanced_Armour_Class_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Enhanced_Armour_Class_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Enhanced_Armour_Class_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Enhanced_Armour_Class_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Enhanced_Armour_Class_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Enhanced Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Enhanced_Armour_Class_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Enhanced_Armour_Class_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Enhanced_Armour_Class_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Armour_Class_(Condition)\" title=\"Enhanced Armour Class (Condition)\">Enhanced Armour Class</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> increased by 1.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bracing_Band\" title=\"Bracing Band\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ring_E_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_E_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ring_E_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Ring_E_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ring_E_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Ring_E_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Ring_E_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_E_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Ring_E_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bracing_Band\" title=\"Bracing Band\">Bracing Band</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The effect is capped at 1 stack; pushing more than one enemy during the same turn does not grant additional benefits.</li>\n<li>The effect triggers when pushing an enemy in any manner, not just with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shove\" title=\"Shove\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/20px-Shove_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/30px-Shove_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/40px-Shove_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shove\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/20px-Shove_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shove\" title=\"Shove\">Shove</a>. For example, hitting an enemy with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Repelling_Blast\" title=\"Repelling Blast\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp/20px-Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp/30px-Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp/40px-Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Repelling Blast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp/20px-Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/65/Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Repelling_Blast\" title=\"Repelling Blast\">Repelling Blast</a> also provides the +1 AC. This effect is also triggered by:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thorn_Whip\" title=\"Thorn Whip\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp/25px-Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp/38px-Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp/50px-Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thorn Whip\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp/25px-Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thorn_Whip\" title=\"Thorn Whip\">Thorn Whip</a> (and the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sorrowful_Lash\" title=\"Sorrowful Lash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp/25px-Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp/38px-Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp/50px-Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sorrowful Lash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp/25px-Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sorrowful_Lash\" title=\"Sorrowful Lash\">Sorrowful Lash</a> variety)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mobile_Flourish_(Ranged)\" title=\"Mobile Flourish (Ranged)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp/25px-Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp/38px-Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp/50px-Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mobile Flourish (Ranged)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp/25px-Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mobile_Flourish_(Ranged)\" title=\"Mobile Flourish (Ranged)\">Mobile Flourish (Ranged)</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mobile_Flourish_(Melee)\" title=\"Mobile Flourish (Melee)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/25px-Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/38px-Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/50px-Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mobile Flourish (Melee)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/25px-Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mobile_Flourish_(Melee)\" title=\"Mobile Flourish (Melee)\">Mobile Flourish (Melee)</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flurry_of_Blows:_Push\" title=\"Flurry of Blows: Push\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Flurry_of_Blows_Push_Icon.webp/25px-Flurry_of_Blows_Push_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Flurry_of_Blows_Push_Icon.webp/38px-Flurry_of_Blows_Push_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Flurry_of_Blows_Push_Icon.webp/50px-Flurry_of_Blows_Push_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flurry of Blows: Push\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Flurry_of_Blows_Push_Icon.webp/25px-Flurry_of_Blows_Push_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Flurry_of_Blows_Push_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flurry_of_Blows:_Push\" title=\"Flurry of Blows: Push\">Flurry of Blows: Push</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bull_Rush\" title=\"Bull Rush\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Charge_Minotaur_Icon.webp/25px-Charge_Minotaur_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Charge_Minotaur_Icon.webp/38px-Charge_Minotaur_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Charge_Minotaur_Icon.webp/50px-Charge_Minotaur_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bull Rush\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Charge_Minotaur_Icon.webp/25px-Charge_Minotaur_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/44/Charge_Minotaur_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bull_Rush\" title=\"Bull Rush\">Bull Rush</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder\" title=\"Arrow of Roaring Thunder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder\" title=\"Arrow of Roaring Thunder\">Arrow of Roaring Thunder</a></li>\n<li>And any other action that <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Actions_that_push_or_pull\" title=\"Category:Actions that push or pull\">pushes or pulls</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202403\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.070 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.078 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3545/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31724/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12592/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 979929/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   64.441      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   64.441      1 -total\n 34.55%   22.263     10 Template:Icon_link\n 33.18%   21.383     10 Template:Icon_text\n 30.08%   19.382     34 Template:Trim\n 17.70%   11.409     14 Template:Ifempty\n 15.97%   10.291      2 Template:Item_icon\n 15.48%    9.977      6 Template:SAI\n 15.41%    9.932      1 Template:Condition\n 14.97%    9.645      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28543-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202403 and revision id 369909. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}